window.products.push({"id":643020,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine-New Upgraded One-Touch Full Automatic Foodsaver Vacuum Sealer with LED Touch Screen Indicator Lights,Air Sealing System for Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gLCaVq2NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩【Extend 10X Longer Freshness & Money Saver】Upgraded powerful vacuum pump provides strong suction, along with advanced sealing technology, keeping your food fresh for up to 10X times longer. Reduce your food bills and waste leftovers with our high-quality vacuum sealer. 🥦【LED Touch Screen & Easy to Use】The vacuum sealer machine adopts full automatic operation by touching screen with LED indicator light，The screen is clear and easy to operate. The elderly and children can use it. Just put the food into the ended bags and insert it into the machine, then choose the mode you need according to the food. When the key light blinks, the machine starts to work. When the key light stops blinking, the flip plate automatically resets and the sealing is completed. 🦐【5MM Upgrade widened heating wire & Multi-pack sealing】Our vacuum sealer machine use 5MM upgraded widened heating wire. Compared with the traditional 3MM heating wire, 5MM has a stronger sealing effect, strong sealing and no air leakage. Continuous multi-pack sealing, 31 cm long sealing more efficient. 🌽【5 Adjustable Modes】The vacuum sealer machine is equipped with 5 sealing modes-Seal/Exter VAC/Manual/Dry/Moist,Just put your bag into the machine, choose any mode, it will start to vacuum and seal automatically. You can choose the dry setting for solid food items and the moist setting for poached, simmered or steamed food. Provide your food with the best possible preservation based on your different types. 🍇【What You Get】1 x Vacuum Sealer Machine,15 x Vacuum Sealer Bags (7.87\" x 9.87\"),1 x accessory hose,1 x User Manual, 1 x AC Adapter. This vacuum sealer meets applicable product safety testing standards and is durable，If you have any question about Akjbl’s Vacuum Sealer Machine, please contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gLCaVq2NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Akjbl","source_asin":"B0C7C7W366","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7C7W366","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7C7W366","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643021,"name":"Trends International NHL Carolina Hurricanes - Mask 16 Wall Poster, 22.375\" x 34\", Unframed Version","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-Zx4p7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trends International wall posters are everyone's favorite room decor! Our posters are created with high-resolution artwork and are printed on glossy poster paper which enhances the colors to make a bold wall decor statement in any room. Decorate the bedroom, bathroom, kid's room, living room, office, dorm, and more! Our art prints are lightweight and ready-to-frame or they can be hung on the wall using poster mounts, clips, push pins, or nails. Add these decorations alongside the other accessories on your party supplies list too! Trends International's wall posters are the perfect way to dress up your parties. Posters make great gifts as well! Whether it's for a Christmas stocking stuffer, a best friend's birthday, or a house warming gift, they'll love receiving a high-quality poster to show off their style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-Zx4p7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trends International","source_asin":"B01MCZ5JNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCZ5JNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCZ5JNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643022,"name":"J.A. Henckels International Classic Clad 3.5-Quart Dutch Oven with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416YSJ59VEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Henckels International Clad Cookware is tri-ply cookware composed of 18/10 stainless, aluminum and magnetic stainless. The middle aluminum layer extends from the base up the sides of the pan so the heat is conducted evenly throughout the pan. This incre Amazon.com A wide, deep pot, this 3-1/2-quart covered Dutch oven is ideal for braising meats on the stovetop, then transferring to oven baking. Lifting the pot when it's full of chili or stew is facilitated by two strongly riveted square handles; a third tops the stainless-steel lid. Clad in gleaming stainless steel, the Dutch oven is constructed with an inner core of aluminum across the bottom and up the sides for even, efficient cooking at low to medium temperatures. Whisks, spoons, and cleaning brushes all glide smoothly along the curved inner contour of the pot, and the lid fits snugly on the flared, easy-pour rim. J.A. Henckels International, the economical division of Zwilling J.A. Henckels, makes the stylish and durable Classic Clad series for serious home cooks. As well as being oven- and broiler-safe up to 500 degrees F, each pot or pan features a brightly polished magnetic stainless-steel exterior safe for all types of stovetop burners: gas, electric, ceramic, induction, and halogen. The 18/10 stainless-steel interior resists sticking, won't react to acidic foods, and welcomes metal utensils. Henckels recommends washing Classic Clad pieces by hand to retain the mirror finish, and covers the cookware with a lifetime warranty against defects. Except for the frying pans, each pot shows liter and quart markings, and every piece comes wrapped in a soft, drawstring gift/storage bag. --Ann Bieri From the Manufacturer Patented ergonomic handle design provides optimal control, comfort, and balance. The end of the handle has a hanging hole which saves storage space in the kitchen. Unique hollow cast handle design and V-shaped connection to pot keeps handle cooler. Side and lid handles are designed to avoid contact with hot surfaces. Larger pans have helper handles to allow for easy and safe lifting of pans. Flared rim design for ease of pouring and optimal strength. Pan interiors have a curved corner design to allow for easy cleaning. Capacity markings on most items for ease in measuring ingredients for recipes. Code markings on pans and lids makes for easy selection of correct size lid for each pan. The domed shape of the lids fit securely to retain moisture through self-basting. This prevents loss of flavor and vitamins and reduces cooking time. All pans are oven and broiler safe up to 500 degrees fahrenheit and provide cook and serve versatility. The pans have a wide range of stopetop compatibility and can be used with all popular cook top surfaces such as as electric, gas, ceramic, halogen, and induction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416YSJ59VEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HENCKELS","source_asin":"B0006GCEMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006GCEMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006GCEMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
