window.products.push({"id":643069,"name":"EDENATURE Couch Arm Covers - Stretch Armchair Cover Polyester Office Chair Armrest Covers for Sofa, Anti-Stain and Washable Arm Chair Slipcover - Burg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AioJ27ppL._AC_SL1478_.jpg","description":"ARM CHAIR ARM COVERS: The Stretch armchair slipcover are made with a textured grid that can update worn-out furniture, make it appear brand new, and add style and refinement to your home's interior decor. Give your armrests a fresh appearance with this arm chair cover while guarding against everyday deterioration, stains, and scratches. You can easily and quickly extend the life of your armrest using arm rest protectors. DIMENSIONS OF COUCH ARM COVERS: Our armchair cover basically fits a sandbox, armchair, or cantilever. Couch arm protectors are suitable for armrests that are 20–24 inches long, 6.5-8 inches wide, and 8–11 inches high. and can be stretched to fit your unique furniture. Sofa arm covers for new and vintage furniture are exactly what you need to update your old sofa! HIGH-QUALITY ARMREST COVER: Sofa arm covers are made with 100% polyester fabric that is thicker and softer. With their soft, lightweight stretch fabric, these sofa arm covers fits most arm shapes and sizes. Couch arm covers for sofa are easy to remove and put back on. These recliner arm covers come in a color choice. Match them with a variety of colors and themes to complement your existing couch or chair. MACHINE WASHABLE ARM CHAIR SLIPCOVER: These arm covers for chairs and sofas are machine washable, so it's easy to keep them clean. For easy care and maintenance, machine-wash separately in cold water on the gentle cycle. For drying, tumble dry low and remove armrest covers promptly from dryer. Use the arm rest cover to keep your couch or favorite sitting chair from fading while also protecting it from spills and debris. EASY INSTALLATION OF CHAIR ARM COVERS: Locate the corner, drape the furniture arm over it, smooth it. Chair arm covers protectors will fit precisely whether your couch has a square arm, a curved arm, or a reclining arm. It is difficult to slide or move because of the anti-slip construction of these armchair covers for the arms. Please get in touch with us if you have any questions or concerns about our office chair armrest covers, and we'll do all we can to address them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AioJ27ppL._AC_SL1478_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDENATURE","source_asin":"B097DH88PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DH88PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DH88PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
