window.products.push({"id":643251,"name":"Flash Furniture Tybee 44.25''W x 21.625''D White Computer Desk with Keyboard Tray and Drawers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":188.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AhdRnY8uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make a bold statement in your home office, dorm room or living room with this contemporary style computer desk. Boasting a glossy white finish paired with shiny chrome crisscross legs, the on-trend design of this writing desk will definitely be noticed. This home office desk features two box drawers for storing small, important items like that pen you can never find or sticky notes. The pull-out keyboard platform gets your keyboard off of the desktop to free up space and adds a clean appearance. Investing in a desk for your home makes working from home, studying for that big test or managing household bills and paperwork a much more pleasant experience. The sturdy chrome frame holds up to 110 lbs. to accommodate your laptop or desktop computer as well as decor. The laminate top resists nicks and scratches to keep this piece looking new for years to come. This small computer desk can also pull double duty as a display area for family photos and keepsakes and is sleek enough to be right at home in you entryway. This low maintenance desk can be easily cleaned with a water based cleaner. Plastic floor glides will protect your tile or hardwoods if you want to move things around for a fresh look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AhdRnY8uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B01IHVFU1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IHVFU1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IHVFU1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643252,"name":"SVEN Ceramics Presidio Line: Large Handthrown Shino Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QKFaenGDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This large mug is from our Presidio Line. Each cup is handmade and thrown individually on a wheel, and so each one is unique. They are similar enough to each other to be paired together in sets, but each will most likely vary in some small way--but that's how you'll know its been handcrafted, rather than made by a machine or by a mold. The cup(s) that you will receive will look very similar to the one in the photos. The glaze that we used for these cups is a Shino, which has a lot of variation in its color and pattern, though on this Black Mountain clay it always has a warm golden brown base. Sometimes carbon trapping occurs, which creates a cheetah-like effect in the glaze. Its the nature of the glaze to be unpredictable, which is something we like about it. These cups are perfect for your cup of tea or coffee if you prefer large cups! Each cup holds 16 fluid ounces, and are 4\" tall and 3 1/2\" in diameter. All of our glazes created by us from scratch from all natural and non-toxic materials. All of our ceramics are high fired, making them dishwasher, microwave, and oven safe. Made in San Francisco.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QKFaenGDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SVEN Ceramics","source_asin":"B015VPWMVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015VPWMVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015VPWMVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
