window.products.push({"id":643256,"name":"Ceramic Japanese Ramen Bowl Set, 9-inch (60oz) Pho Bowls And Spoons Set - W/ 2 Chopsticks, 2 Spoons And 2 Chopstick Holders - Perfect For Serving Nood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Je8vnNS9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quote to Justin M one of our customers on Reviewed: I love these bowls. They're large and allow for me to put a bunch of stuff in my bowl to dress up my ramen. I don't make ramen often because it can be a bit laborious, but when I put it in this bowl, it makes for a much more enjoyable experience. With covid disrupting the restaurants and ramen spots I used to frequent, I have had a bit of a void in my life. These bowls have helped me have that restaurant experience at home. It seems a little dramatic, but treat yourself to a restaurant experience at home and you'll realize something's been missing this whole time. The capacity seems like a lot but I don't think anyone should be filling it up to the rim. All in all, these bowls have been getting a good amount of use and I'm very happy with my purchase. The chopsticks and spoons and holders were a very nice addition to complete the set (even though I already had some). Because this ramen soup bowl uses a more authentic Japanese style design and matching solid wood chopsticks, spoons and holders, using it to serve ramen noodles allows you to have the same experience at home as you would at a restaurant or ramen spot, making up for the momentary inability to go out and enjoy ramen. Accessories include a cotton and linen bag with a Japanese wave pattern, great for storing chopsticks, spoons, and holders that can be easily carried around. Use it the next time you go out for ramen or a meal without using disposable or unclean utensils and develop a green lifestyle. Because this ramen soup bowl uses a more authentic Japanese style design and matching solid wood chopsticks, spoons and holders, using it to serve ramen noodles allows you to have the same experience at home as you would at a restaurant or ramen spot, making up for the momentary inability to go out and enjoy ramen. Accessories include a cotton and linen bag with a Japanese wave pattern, great for storing chopsticks, spoons, and holders that can be easily carried around. Use it the next time you go out for ramen or a meal without using disposable or unclean utensils and develop a green lifestyle. Accessories include a cotton and linen bag with a Japanese wave pattern, great for storing chopsticks, spoons, and holders that can be easily carried around. Use it the next time you go out for ramen or a meal without using disposable or unclean utensils and develop a green lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Je8vnNS9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Relaxing Garden","source_asin":"B0965Q1G3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0965Q1G3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0965Q1G3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
