window.products.push({"id":643293,"name":"Personalized Pirate Ship Ornaments for Kids – Polyresin Pirate Ship Christmas Ornament – Boys Pirate Ornament – Halloween Ornaments – Unique Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71byJpcY2mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Christmas Pirate Ship Decorations – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our pirate ornament 2022 is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a pirate ship ready to set sail! This Holiday season, let your little pirates imagination sail off towards the high seas with these adorable pirate hanging decorations! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized boys’ ornaments for Christmas tree often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. All our pirate ship decorations are delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND kid pirate ship toy ornament and miniature pirate figurines you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your family’s imagination. Remember and cherish your children’s favorite toys with this pirate decor that will always bring smile to your little one's face. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, these Caribbean pirate decorations will delight your family and make decorating the tree even more fun! The perfect personalized Christmas gift for any fun-loving child that loves sailing the water! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our tiny pirate ship ornaments make beautiful personalized gifts for kids, pirate party decorations, pirate party favors, pirate Halloween decorations and pirate themed keepsake to cherish every Holiday season. Your pirate ship decoration will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect Christmas gifts for kids to create loving and lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Little Pirates – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful kid ornaments for Christmas tree and Halloween tree ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your pirate ship home decor, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71byJpcY2mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07GC8N6CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GC8N6CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GC8N6CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
