window.products.push({"id":643452,"name":"TeakCraft Teak Round Cutting Board With Juice Groove, Serving Tray, Set of 2 (13.5 x 13.5 x 0.75), FSC Certified Carving Board, The Bestla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ew3a9qIJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This reversible teak round wood cutting board is made of premium grade Indonesian teak wood, giving your serving tray a stylish appearance and easy to use kitchen cutting board material. Since it’s made of 100% sustainably grown teak wood, the board is too durable for knives to leave massive cuts or scratches on it, making for a long lasting cutting board and easy clean up since there are no cracks to hide in. The TeakCraft cutting board is even knife friendly, so you don’t need to worry about your blades being damaged. Our consumers are the top priority. Exchange your timber or plastic cutting boards for this quality rectangle end grain carving board backed by a lifetime assurance. Complying with these easy steps will ensure longevity for your cutting board. Cleansing: ● Keep your solid chopping board tidy by washing with soap and water after each usage. ● Make sure to rinse off all residue soap. ● Pad all the water down with a towel until the cutting board is completely dry. Preserving: ● Use a small drop of food-grade mineral oil. ● Make sure to use food quality mineral oil - no veggie oils Care: ● Do not use in the microwave or stove. Do not clean in the dishwasher. Hand Wash only. ● Do not position warm pots or mugs on top of the surface of the cutting board, as this can leave scorch marks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ew3a9qIJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeakCraft","source_asin":"B08GGCWHDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GGCWHDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GGCWHDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
