window.products.push({"id":643502,"name":"County Line Kitchen Water Infuser Pitcher, Infuse Fruit, Juice & Teas, 2qt (64 oz / 1.9 Liter), Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ry+f48xgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Infusion Fun: Enjoy flavor-infused water and beverages with our custom made, patent-pending infuser filter. Comes with jar, handled flip-cap lid and infuser. All items BPA Free and food safe Strain and Enjoy: Our infusion system comes with a strainer piece that fits right into the flip cap lid, allowing you to pour your infused beverage without any fruit spilling into your cup Table Art: turn your table into a beautiful piece of art while you display your infusion creation; transparent jar and filter allow you to showcase the beautiful contents inside Easy Pour Dispenser, Leak-Proof Lid: With the flip cap lid, infusing, pouring and storage is easy! Tight seal means your jar will never have a leak. Durable Mason Jar: Mason Jars withstand rough handling and don't leach harmful chemicals. Jars are dishwasher safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ry+f48xgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"County Line Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BHL3BGQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHL3BGQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHL3BGQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643503,"name":"Over the Sink Colander Strainer Basket with Silicone Grip Pads to Prevent Movement - Extendable - Wash Vegetables and Fruits Drain Cooked Pasta and Dr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Vy3-5q8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FRUSTRATION GONE - Who needs more stress in their life? There’s nothing worse than rinsing your veggies in a strainer while the strainer is slipping and sliding all over the place. INTRODUCING: Undermount silicone grip pads. You will not believe what a game changer this is. We tried out all the other colanders in the market and couldn’t stand the movement! With the 2 grip pads perfectly placed under each handle you will finally enjoy the stability you’ve been missing in your life. SUPER VERSATILE - Easy to use, multipurpose, call it what you want. Just simplify my life. This colander is your all-in-one solution. Extend it over your kitchen sink (handsfree baby!) to rinse veggies and fruit, drain pasta and even thaw frozen food in it instead leaving it to leak all over your counter. And when you’re done? Use it as a dish rack to air dry utensils, cups and small plates etc. GOT YOU COVERED - Adjustable, this over the sink colander expands from 13.5 inches to a whopping 19 inches enabling it to cover >99% of standard sink sizes. When not in use, simply close it for easy storage. And thanks to its square design, the strainer is also deeper than most others providing a larger area to fit in more fruits or vegetables to speed up your time prepping. DRAINS FAST - Extra large holes on the bottom of the basket help to drain water quickly so the colander doesn’t fill up and overflow, while also preventing food from falling through. The drain holes measure up to 0.3 inches in diameter, so do not use with small grains such as rice, quinoa, lentils etc. Dishwasher Safe. BPA FREE - At Olive & Oak, we value family and relationships. We believe every product in your kitchen should be safe and free from nasties so you can be sure that you’re preparing healthy meals for your family. This plastic colander is 100% BPA Free and heat resistant to over 200 degrees Fahrenheit so you can focus on creating memories that’ll last forever. GIVING BACK - At Olive & Oak, we believe in being there and taking care of each other. That’s why we donate 10% of our profits to registered charities that promote love, acceptance and kindness as well as organizations that undertake humanitarian aid to help those in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Vy3-5q8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLIVE & OAK HOMEWARE","source_asin":"B0B6GWWM94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6GWWM94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6GWWM94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
