window.products.push({"id":643538,"name":"Chauffee CHAUFFEE Coffee Mug Warmer with Mug Set, Auto Shut Off Gravity-Induction, Smart USB Coffee Cup Warmer for Desk. Father's Day, Birthday Gifts ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R+BJx5wbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Never have a sip of cold coffee after today. Why reach to the microwave or pour your coffee from a thermos? Consider our CHAUFFEE mug warmer set, CHAUFFEE Cup warmer maintains your beverage at an ideal temperature (131°F / 55°C). No need to worry about high temperature and high oxidation. The Best Gift of Choice CHAUFFEE Coffee Mug Warmer with Mug Set is for office and home use. The ideal gift for your loved ones on any occasion, for Birthdays, Christmas, valentine' s day, Mothers' s day, Father’s day, Thanksgiving day. What CHAUFFEE Mug Warmer can do? The Cup Warmer keeps all your favorite beverages warm enough, keeping your drink at the perfect temperature from the first sip to the last drop enjoying the warmth it brings throughout your busy day. Compact Design and Waterproof It's light and small, it does not take up office space. It has a waterproof design, easy to clean, safe and reliable. Anytime, Anywhere, Easy to Operate Wherever you are, you can enjoy a constant temperature drink. It has a built-In Gravity Induction Switch, when the warmer plate sense enough weight, it will turn on automatically, and when you take the cup away, the warmer plate will auto shut off. No need to turn it ON/OFF manually. Powered by any devices with output 5V USB port such as computer, desktop, laptop, tablet and so on. Ready for Gift Giving The gift set comes with tempered glass mug warmer, high quality ceramic mug with a lid and a stainless-steel spoon, it comes in a lovely gift packaging, ready for gifting. Treat yourself and your loved ones with this inspiring and practical gift, put a smile on their faces and keep them warm every day with this exquisite gift set. Please Note: The warmer is designed to keep your heated drinks warm. If you want to heat a cold coffee, it will take more time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R+BJx5wbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chauffee","source_asin":"B09PFSZ3N1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PFSZ3N1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PFSZ3N1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
