window.products.push({"id":643577,"name":"NTBAY Velvet Soft Solid Color Zipped Toddler Pillowcases, 2 Pack Cozy Luxury Zippered Plush Travel Pillow Cases, 13x18 Inches, Charcoal Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TedU9CNAL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Velvet PRODUCT FEATURES: These super soft pillowcases are made of premium quality velvet for easy care, longevity and luxury. Nice smooth velvet fabric texture is fitted with matching hidden zipper to allow easy inserting and removing of pillow inserts and keep the pillow stay in place. These solid color pillowcases featuring wrinkle, shrink and fade resistance. The durable velvet fabric is not easy pilling after frequent wash. PRODUCT FUNCTION: These warm and solid color pillowcases can perfectly decorate your room in a luxury and fashionable way. These delicate pillowcases can coordinate with living rooms, bedrooms, sofas, couches and beds that are in any colors and styles. They could always light up the room as beautiful decors. The surface fluff forms an air layer, which is very warm and can keep you away from the cold in autumn and winter, and you will fall in love with them. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 2 x Toddler Pillowcases (13 x18 Inches) (Pillows are not included). Fits pillows branded at Celeep, KeaBabies, Little Sleepy Head, Little One's Pillow, TILLYOU, EXQ Home and so on. Search ASIN \"B0758C2F79\" to get NTBAY matching toddler pillows. EASY CARE: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle. Do not soak, bleach and iron. Dry up quickly after washing. These pillowcases in different light intensity and angle, the surface will produce plush silver reflective, so that the products exhibit different colors. SATISFACTORY SALES SERVICE: We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer 90 days return and replacement service. We also provide it with a life time free customer service. If you find that our products have quality problems, just contact us and we will solve the problem for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TedU9CNAL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NTBAY","source_asin":"B08D2WBDB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D2WBDB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D2WBDB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
