window.products.push({"id":643685,"name":"Butterfly Shower Curtain for Bathroom with Wisteria,Purple Floral Bath Curtain with 12 Hooks,Watercolor Butterfly with Flowers Decorative Artistic,72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nQDFsyYuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Butterfly Shower Curtain measures 72x72 inches for broad full coverage. The stylish shower curtain in butterfly flying around purple Flower pattern is suitable for any type of bathroom. Fabric Floral Shower Curtain Set with 12 Hooks quickly creates a fresh new-look for your bathroom decor, and provides a comfortable private space to linger. The waterproof polyester shower curtain adopts Four-layer process.Butterfly Shower Curtain printing pattern is very realistic, the color is bright and not fading. The surfaces of the fabric are covered with waterproof material, making it easy to clean. It can be cleaned with a quick rinse or wipe after a shower.  Easy Care:Wash cold, gentle. Lay flat to dry. Do not bleach, and No dry-cleaning. Do not iron. Steam Iron is ok. The Style for you: Modern Style: Bright colors and vivid patterns add vitality to your modern bathrooms, so that you can still feel the freshness and beauty of nature while bathing. Vivid Pattern:The watercolor shower curtain in butterfly flowers print is suitable for any bathroom furniture.Creative and unique pattern makes you enjoy your bath time. Note: All dimensions are measured manually with deviation (ranged) at 1-3cm. Item may be a little different from the picture due to the lighting and your monitor’s display. Package: 1 x Butterfly shower curtain 12 x plastic hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nQDFsyYuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denifeiya","source_asin":"B09576RL84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09576RL84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09576RL84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
