window.products.push({"id":643730,"name":"Wallmonkeys Part Town Boston New Wall Mural Peel and Stick Graphic (72 in W x 46 in H) WM350062","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gl63pe3dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our Fine Art themed wall murals allow you to display famous works of art by the artist of your choice on any wall in your home, bedroom, living room, or office. We have the largest selection of art themed wall clings online with access to thousands of artworks spanning the entire history of art. Choose from famous artists such as Van Gogh, Monet, Leonardo Da Vinci and Rembrandt. We carry images focusing on everything from the renaissance to romanticism, impressionism, realism, modern art and pop art. Our premium vinyl material and superior ink guarantees you the highest quality adhesive posters money can buy and an effortless way to add style to any room.  Our murals are simple to install. They peel and stick, a lot like giant wall appliques. Wallmonkeys graphics will never leave a mark, or damage your walls. Wallmonkeys wall peels stick to textured surfaces, and can even bend around curved walls and corners! Available in a variety of sizes and prices, from mini-sized murals to extra large wall murals, WallMonkeys are always a perfect fit. To select the proper size print for your wall, measure the empty space you have to work with. Usually, selecting the item just a little bit smaller than your wall space yields the best results. Have you measured your wall? Our fine art prints are printed on-demand, so PLEASE double check the size of the wall graphic you are ordering prior to clicking the 'ADD TO CART' button. Our adhesive posters ship within 2-3 business days. Designs containing dark colors require the full 3 days to allow inks to dry prior to shipping. Quality is worth the wait.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gl63pe3dL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallmonkeys","source_asin":"B00CK4HQ9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CK4HQ9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CK4HQ9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643731,"name":"Soft Velvet Stretch Fitted Dining Chair Seat Covers, Removable Washable Anti-Dust Dining Room Upholstered Chair Seat Cushion Cover Kitchen Chair Prote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iuH050D3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soft Velvet Stretch Spandex Dining Room Upholstered Chair Seat Covers; Perfect fitted for Your Furniture Make your chair seats look brand new with these super stretchable seat covers. Made of soft smooth stretchy velvet fabric, making it extra cozy and comfortable. It's hard to believe just how soft this cover is until you feel it! Not only is it beautiful, but the velvet material is durable enough to protect your furniture. Like a glove design with elastic edge, it's secures the cover in seconds and easily hides torn, dirty or worn-out upholstery. Whether you’re looking to breathe new life into an old set of dining chairs, or trying to keep a new set looking fresh, our slipcovers contour to dining chairs for a custom-like fit. A look sure to impress even the most critical guests! We do recommend measuring your furniture seat width before purchase to ensure you have the perfect fit. Recommend size: Chair seat cushion width 14''-19'' and depth 14''-19'' and thickness 1.5''-3''. 1. Double check your chair seat size when you release order before; please See our MEASURING GUIDE in the photos. 2.Please allow 1cm-2cm error due to manual measurements, yours understand will be much appreciated. The cover is machine washable remove and dryable, so you can keep your cover looking fresh and new, time and time again! Please note: we do recommend washing and drying your slipcover before first use to remove any wrinkles. Every purchase includes a 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee: This chair seat cover is sold with a full money-back guarantee. If you are at all unsatisfied with your product, please contact us (through Amazon if past the standard return window) and we will be happy to assist you. At the end of the day we want our customers to be happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iuH050D3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FWQ","source_asin":"B07Q871GXQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q871GXQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q871GXQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
