window.products.push({"id":643739,"name":"Windy Hill Collection 14\" Inch Standing Coastal African American Ethnic Angel Christmas Tree Topper or Table Top 514102","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yVliKXKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are so many layers to this beautiful coastal Angel. Her coat has a seascape turquoise pattern against a cream-colored background. The turquoise sash (with a hidden wire to modify into any position) has two sides, one shiny, one matte for added contrast. Her gown is a shimmering aquamarine color framed with white faux fur trim. She has a delicate white ribbon tied in the middle of her dress, and is holding a white fishnet sash adorned with seashells. She has a tiny iridescent pearl around her neck against white faux fur trim. And most importantly, the expression on her face exudes brings peace and serenity. Her style design matches exactly with the 16” Aquamarine Ethnic Santa (Windy Hill Collection 161032), as a pair representing the true Christmas in July spirit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yVliKXKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy Hill Collection","source_asin":"B08ZJRKQRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJRKQRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJRKQRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
