window.products.push({"id":643744,"name":"ermete® Leak-Proof 4-compartment Bento Lunch Box for Kids with Removable Divider,Hand-held Lunch Container for Age 4-10 Daycare/School lunches,Microwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NjCOrePaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅LOVELY LUNCH COMPANION: Ermete kids lunch box is made of food grade safe material and has FDA certification. The prints full of wonderful fantasy and childishness are very popular with children. Diverse elements with romantic colors evoke a good mood and make kids eat their meals with relish. With this beautiful bento box, the journey to school will get more pleasant than before. Applicable age: above 4 years old. ✅LEAK PROOF & DROP PROOF: The unique leak-proof seal groove on the lid precisely and tightly fits the lunch box container, which is also fixed by a kid-friendly latch; thus you won’t worry about food mixture and leaking out anymore. Sturdy ABS shell and mellow edges endow this boys girls lunch box excellent drop resistance; kids do not worry that they break the bento lunch box by accident. ✅NIFTY LUNCH BOX WITH HANDLE: This portable lunch container for kids is designed with a flexible and detachable handle, easy for small hands to carry and convenient for those on-the-go kids. With this nifty lunch box, kids can take healthy and yummy meals prepared by parents in school picnics, road trips or any outdoor activities. Mum also does not need to prepare a separate lunch bag. ✅MICROWAVE,FREEZER & DISHWASHER SAFE: The entire kids bento box is freezer safe. To heat food safely, please fetch out the compartment tray(withstanding temperature: -4℉~240℉). Besides, the leak-proof seal panel in the lid can also be detached and cleaned up in the dishwasher. Note: do not put the outer shell of the kids lunch container in the dish washer or microwave. ✅SATISFYING KIDS' VARIOUS FOOD COLLOCATION: This lunch box kids has 4 compartments portioned perfectly for children’s appetite; the bigger compartment(1.75cup/18.5oz) can serve an entire sandwich; two compartments(0.5cup/5.7oz) can serve snacks, fruits, vegetables, bacon, sausage, etc; the sauce compartment is 3.2tbsp/1.6oz. The lunch box for kids boys girls is available in various food collocation and achieves nutrition balance for daycare, preschool, kindergarten or school lunches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NjCOrePaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ermete","source_asin":"B0BLHBHQDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHBHQDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHBHQDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
