window.products.push({"id":643774,"name":"Dutsekk 47\"x22\" Full Length Mirror with Lights, Full Body Mirror with Lights Dimmable, Mirror with Lights Full Length Wall Mounted Color Temperature A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713X32EbZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Innovative Smart Touch Technology] -- Abandoning the traditional mechanical switch, our full length mirror with lights adopts smart touch technology. Long press the on/off button to adjust brightness. Short touch the color temperature button to change the light color between 3000K, 4500K and 6000K, long press to realize the stepless change of 3000-6000K. You can turn off the button light by long pressing the on/off button when turning off the mirror light, without disturbing your sleep. [Advanced Anti-dead Bead Technology] -- The built in led light strip adopts high color rendering LED chips, low light decay, energy saving and high brightness. Using safety copper core wire, better conductivity and fast heat dissipation, stable current, protect the lamp beads from burning out. If one lamp bead does not emit light, the others lamp beads will glow normally, it will not affect the entire light strip. 50,000 hours lifetime. [Full Body Mirror] -- Our full length mirror with lights is large enough for you to see your entire figure in a single glance. The modern and stylish appearance can match various decorative styles. It can be used in bedroom, living room, cloakroom, beauty salon, hair salon, restaurant, hotel and so on. [Aviation Aluminum Alloy Frame & SQ Grade Float Glass] -- The full length mirror with lights adopts aviation aluminum alloy frame which is strong, anti-rust and elegant. Supports horizontal and vertical hanging. The power port is on the side, so the power cord will not be pressed when the mirror is hung on the wall. Using SQ grade float glass, is more high-definition and corrosion-resistant compared to automotive grade. [Upgraded Packaging] -- The improved packaging has passed drop test, impact test, heavy pressure test. Is greatly reduces damage during transportation. If there are any problems, please feel free to contact us. We will response with the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713X32EbZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dutsekk","source_asin":"B096ZS6HJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096ZS6HJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096ZS6HJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
