window.products.push({"id":643806,"name":"SVAVO Touchless Soap Dispenser 8.42oz/250ml, IPX6 Waterproof Battery Operated Electric Automatic Soap Dispenser with Clean Mode for Home Bathroom, Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ioROeS0XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶ Sanitary Hygiene Experience - SVAVO automatic soap dispenser adopts safer contactless infrared sensor technology to automatically deliver your preferred amount of soap when you approach your hand near the sensor zone as far away as 2.75 inches, providing sanitary, non-touch hand hygiene and personal care experience, decreasing the risks of cross-infection with various bacteria and viruses. The soft rubber nozzle features as dripping or trailing prevention and keeps your countertop mess-free. ▶ Space-saving and Versatile - The minimalist design and sleek surface makes SVAVO sensor soap dispenser a perfect match and a must-have for households, with 5 color options to cater for various decoration style. The compact size also makes it portable and not occupying too much space. It's available to use hand wash, dish detergent and makeup remover to meet your different needs. Note: it is not eligible to use gel, or else may cause product malfunction. ▶ Adjustable Volume & LED Indicator - SVAVO automatic hand soap dispenser is quite easy to set up and simple to use. One function button simply satisfies all function settings, including power ON / OFF, 2 volume level settings and clean mode, syncing with LED indicator lights to get full knowledge of function status, sparing any of your confusion. ▶ Energy Efficient & Waterproof Base Design - The touchless battery operated automatic soap dispenser uses 4 pcs AAA alkaline batteries (not included) and the battery compartment is sealed tightly with a screw. A plus to double protection of the battery compartment is the waterproof base with rubber seals, keeping water away from getting into the dispenser and prolonging the life span. The rubber ring also equips the dispenser a fully non-slip design, making it stable on any countertops. ▶ 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - SVAVO will always strive to boost personal and public hygiene and serve customers with quality dispensers. If you are not totally happy with your dispenser, it's hassle-free to return it for a full refund or replacement within 90 days. If you have any problem after 90 days yet within 1 year, we will repair or replace it. Any time you have any issues, please contact us via Amazon's email system. We will spare no effort to provide satisfactory solutions for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ioROeS0XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SVAVO","source_asin":"B08W3G6PGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W3G6PGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W3G6PGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
