window.products.push({"id":643887,"name":"Pizza Peel Aluminum Metal Pizza Paddle 12 x 14 inch - CAPMESSO Pizza Cutter 14'' Rocker Blade Pizza Spatula for Pizza Stone, Pizza Oven Accessories (P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cbfxkbuNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Metal Pizza Peel - PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of commercial grade aluminium and foldable natural pine wooden handle.12” x 25” (fully extended) ,12”x 14” (folded).Can withstand 14 inch pizza. Compatible with Uuni 3, Pizzeria Pronto, Mastercraft, Green Egg and most commercial pizza ovens. Pizza Peel Metal - PICK UP & TRANSFER: Designed safely and conveniently for transferring pizzas, bread, pastries or cake sheets to and from the oven, this Metal Pizza Paddle is a must have for any baker and pizza chef. Don’t use it as a pizza board to cut pizza - you’ll damage your blades! Use cornmeal or flour on your pizza spatula to prevent the dough from sticking and help your pizza slide easier. Pizza Paddle - EASY CLEANING WITH DURABILITY: Unlike wooden peels which are hard to maintain,and humid to breed bacteria, this rust-proof metal pizza peel is easy to clean; simply turn the metal knob to remove the wooden handle, handwash the pizza slider with a soft sponge to prevent scratching. 12in Pizza Peel - EASY GRIP & FOLDABLE HANDLE: The curved shape 12-inch long wooden handle with durable knob provides a firm and comfortable grip, allows you to flexibly transfer pizzas while keeping a safe distance from the heat of the oven. Moreover,the metal knob allows you to lock or fold the handle inward for saving place. The leather string can be used to hang the pizza spatula to dry or store. Pizza Accessories and Supplies ：Purchase includes The Pizza Wheel Cutter,which is made of non slip ABS padded, helps guiding the wheel while slicing the food, designed with long and curved thumb guard protects your fingers from injuries.Perfect gift set with delicate package for Homemade Pizza Enthusiasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cbfxkbuNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAPMESSO","source_asin":"B08P5FMG44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P5FMG44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P5FMG44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643888,"name":"Eskimo Blackout Window Curtain Panel Grommet Top Drapes 2 Panel Set Room Darkening Thermal Insulated Blackout Drapes for Bedroom (W52 x L63,Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ag02V0qhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Block out light, and reduce noise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ag02V0qhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eskimo","source_asin":"B01MZ1YE68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ1YE68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ1YE68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643889,"name":"BeeGreen 12 Pack Cat Reusable Grocery Bags with Storage Pouch Reusable Shopping Bags Bulk with Elastic Band 50LBS Extra Large-Foldable-Machine Washabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FQfUCEwZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12 PACK & EXQUISITE CAT PRINTS: The reusable grocery bags contains 12 pack bags in different cat patterns, which can meet groceries, outdoor activities, parties, festival usage in a time. Different prints make our fabric bags suitable for daily use, and when grocery shopping, you can designate different style bags for different things. The unique cat patterns add more fun to your life and perfect as gifts for various parties and festivals. X-LARGE CAPACITY & DURABLE: Our shopping bags for groceries measure about W15\"*H15.8\"*D4.7\" with the 9.5-inch handle which can easily hold 50 Lbs or 2-3 shopper bags of stuff. All tote bags bulk are made of polyester fabric which is lightweight yet sturdy and all seams are reinforced with bias tape which makes reusable tote bags strong enough to pack heavy groceries, like canned goods, gallons of milk. MULTI-PURPOSE: The reusable tote bags have long and wide handles, allowing you to hand hold or wear on the shoulder for easier carrying. Both women and men can use these bags to hold groceries and commodities for daily use. These are excellent storage bags to hold food, fruits, snacks and necessities while travelling or picnicking. And our cloth tote bags have exquisite floral patterns, so excellent for birthday party, Thanksgiving and Christmas Day. FOLDABLE & PORTABLE: Our foldable tote bags can be easily wrapped into a small roll with elastic band which takes up hardly any space that can easily fit in a backpack, purse, pocket or the glove box of the car. If you don't like folding, a great choice for you, just drop them into the zipper storage pouch, then you will always have reusable bags with you whether you stop by a store on whim or have an unplanned shopping trip. MACHINE WASHABLE & REUSABLE: Our heavy duty tote bags can be washed by washing machine. You can just throw grocery bags in the washer when they are dirty, and then air-dry for less than 2 hours before proceeding to the next shopping.These shopping bags bulk can help to reduce your impact on the environment by using reusable bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FQfUCEwZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B48MQ9DR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B48MQ9DR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B48MQ9DR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643890,"name":"Ideal Home Range 20 Count Cocktail Napkins, Outlook Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51daX2Y4NQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Dinner party for a dozen, a banquet for a 100, a candlelit dinner for 2, or a family get-together, you'll find the perfect design to match your unique personal style, or mood.  From classical, romantic, vintage, exotic or glamorous, through to happy, country or funky fun IHR adds the perfect accent to every event!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51daX2Y4NQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideal Home Range","source_asin":"B005TSYQ76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005TSYQ76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005TSYQ76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":643891,"name":"Cole & Mason Twister Salt and Pepper Mill Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-TUoGBOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cole and Mason, the leading Brand of salt and pepper mills worldwide, is synonymous with innovative design, product performance, and quality. Our extensive range of mills, from traditional to contemporary, has something to suit every table setting. Cole and Mason's standard mills are fitted with patented mechanisms, stainless steel for pepper and nylon for salt. Our Gourmet mills feature machine cut hardened carbon steel for pepper and ceramic for salt, while the Electronic and Inverta style mills all feature ceramic mechanisms for salt and pepper. The mechanisms are fully adjustable so they deliver freshly ground pepper or sea salt in fine to coarse grinds. All mechanisms have a lifetime guarantee. Our pepper mechanisms strip the peppercorns to break them into smaller pieces so that flavor is slowly released onto food, rather than crushing the corns and squeezing out the pepperin oils, whereby releasing the flavor very quickly into the atmosphere. Stainless steel is an ideal material for the pepper mill as it will not corrode and can be made very sharp, giving improved variability of grind. Our standard salt mechanism has a unique anti-static, clog-free design and is molded for high precision with sharp grinding teeth. Nylon is used due to its hard wearing characteristics. Being non-porous, it does not absorb odors and is therefore suitable for salt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-TUoGBOGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cole & Mason","source_asin":"B003OICZ3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003OICZ3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003OICZ3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
