window.products.push({"id":643989,"name":"TEBILD Humidifiers for Bedroom Plants 9L Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier Top Fill Last Up to 48H with 360°Nozzle,Sleep Mode, Auto Shut-Off,Night Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P6fPUAtgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Leakage & Top Filling Design】-The new LED smart humidifier for large rooms upgraded in 2022 has a large capacity without filter and frequent water addition. Up to 48H of continuous use. The maximum mist can reach 300ml/hour, suitable for rooms of 120-560 sq. ft, including living room, bedroom, etc. Our cool mist humidifiers will turn off automatically at low water levels to prevent dry operation. The top-filling anti-leakage design improves the leakage problem of traditional water tanks. 【Quiet Sleep Mode &12H Timer】-Ultra-quiet baby humidifier uses ultrasound technology not to make any hum, hiss, or crackle sound. The noise is below 35dB, creating a quiet and comfortable sleeping environment for you and your kids. To save power, you can freely set the timer (1-12 hours) by touch or remote control. The portable humidifiers have a removable water tank, a handle, and an extra-large opening to facilitate daily filling, cleaning, and maintenance. 【3 Adjustable Mist Levels & 360°Rotating Nozzle】-This bedroom humidifier is specially designed for you. 3 kinds of mist can be easily adjusted, and freely choose low, medium, and high humidity according to the situation. The 360º nozzle design can adjust the direction of the mist output as needed. It makes the humidity in any corner of the room equalize quickly. Built-in essential oil tray, can add your favorite aroma to the fragrance box on the back. 【Intelligent Constant Humidity & Remote Control】-The humidifier for plants can sense the humidity in the air during operation and adjust it to meet your set requirements. When the humidifier detects that the ambient humidity is more than you set, it will automatically turn off, and vice versa. The ideal indoor humidity range is 40%-60% (adjust 5% per touch). The sensitive touch control panel and remote control are very convenient. The humidifier has 7 colors of lights that can be turned on/off. 【What You Will Get】-As a professional humidifier for a large room manufacturer, we have experienced technicians who are very knowledgeable about any quality issues related to humidifiers. We are sure you will love this premium humidifier. If you need help with any product questions, don't hesitate to contact us; we support 24 hours online service; we help you anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P6fPUAtgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tebild","source_asin":"B0B49PTQB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-643989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B49PTQB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B49PTQB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
